### The monolith's hand-rolled API. Start it with ./mvnw -q exec:java, then run these (IntelliJ or the VS Code REST Client).

### All products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### One product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/SKU-TEA-001

### A product that does not exist: 404 by hand
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/SKU-NOPE

### Stock
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/SKU-KET-001

### Checkout: approved
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"c-1","sku":"SKU-KET-001","quantity":1,"card":"4111111111111111"}

### Checkout: declined (card ends in 0000). Now GET /api/inventory/SKU-KET-001 again. Problem 6.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"c-1","sku":"SKU-KET-001","quantity":1,"card":"4111111111110000"}

### Checkout: malformed JSON. Watch what the hand-rolled parser makes of it (Lab 7).
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"c-1","sku":"SKU-KET-001","quantity":"one","card":"4111111111111111"}

### Checkout: a nested object the parser cannot read
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer":{"id":"c-1"},"sku":"SKU-KET-001","quantity":1,"card":"4111111111111111"}
